            <title>Version 1.3</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 04:24:45 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's new in 1.3</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>New Network pod — live download and upload speeds with a scrolling area chart, interface detail, session totals, and automatic offline detection.</li>
                    <li>Menu bar now supports a Network mode — shows live ↓/↑ speeds directly in the status bar.</li>
                    <li>Smart Auto-Expand now surfaces the Network pod automatically when your Mac goes offline.</li>
                    <li>External Volumes section now shows a clear header alongside the Eject All button.</li>
                    <li>Pod colours now adapt correctly in light mode for improved readability.</li>
                    <li>Settings panel transition smoothed for a more refined feel.</li>
                    <li>Various UI refinements and stability improvements.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
